# Required tools

**Normative registry** for tools this center expects on the operator machine.
Missions that install or verify tooling **must** read this file — do not invent
a second required-tools list.

When adding a tool later, append a row under **Tool inventory** with every
required field. Prefer official docs and install pages; keep dry-run commands
executable without further browsing.

## Schema (per tool)

| Field | Required | Meaning |
|-------|----------|---------|
| **`id`** | yes | Stable kebab-case tool id (also usual CLI name when identical) |
| **`cli`** | yes | Primary command name for `command -v` / PATH probes |
| **`minVersion`** | yes | Minimum semver (or tool-native version string) the center accepts |
| **`docsUrl`** | yes | Primary documentation URL |
| **`installUrl`** | yes | Installation documentation URL (may equal docs when install is a subsection) |
| **`macosMethods`** | yes | Ordered list of install method ids allowed on macOS |
| **`windowsMethods`** | yes | Ordered list of install method ids allowed on Windows |
| **`dryRuns`** | yes | Ordered list of `{ command, expect }` checks after install |

**Method ids** are labels only — the install procedure for each id lives on
**`installUrl`**. Agents **must not** invent methods absent from the tool’s
`macosMethods` / `windowsMethods` lists.

## Tool inventory

### `rclone`

| Field | Value |
|-------|--------|
| **id** | `rclone` |
| **cli** | `rclone` |
| **minVersion** | `1.60.0` |
| **docsUrl** | https://rclone.org/docs/ |
| **installUrl** | https://rclone.org/install/ |

**macOS methods (`macosMethods`):**

| Method id | Notes (from install docs — follow `installUrl` for exact commands) |
|-----------|---------------------------------------------------------------------|
| `curl` | Official `install.sh` via curl (Linux/macOS/BSD script path) |
| `brew` | Homebrew: `brew install rclone` |
| `port` | MacPorts: `sudo port install rclone` |

**Windows methods (`windowsMethods`):**

| Method id | Notes (from install docs — follow `installUrl` for exact commands) |
|-----------|---------------------------------------------------------------------|
| `winget` | `winget install Rclone.Rclone` |
| `precompiled-zip` | Download zip from downloads.rclone.org; extract `rclone.exe` onto PATH |

**dryRuns:**

| # | `command` | `expect` |
|---|-----------|----------|
| 1 | `rclone version` | Exit **0**; stdout includes a version ≥ **`minVersion`** |
| 2 | `rclone listremotes` | Exit **0** (empty remote list is OK) |

## Agent obligations

1. Treat this inventory as the **only** required-tools source for this center.
2. Probe with the shell using **`cli`** (and any **user-supplied path/command** from
   the install mission gate) before proposing install.
3. Compare discovered version to **`minVersion`** — classify **ok**, **outdated**,
   or **missing**.
4. Install only after structured-choice consent; use only listed OS method ids;
   read procedures from **`installUrl`**.
5. After install (or path override), run **every** **`dryRuns`** row in order and
   record pass/fail.

